   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Message flow\n\n1. Client connects and sends its name as the first line\n2. Server calls ChatRoom.Join → \"*** Geir joined ***\" to all\n3. Client sends a line → server calls ChatRoom.SendMessage\n4. ChatRoom creates a ChatMessage and broadcasts it\n5. Each TcpClientConnection writes it to its client\n6. /quit or disconnect → ChatRoom.Leave → \"*** left ***\"",
   "originalText": "Message flow\n\n1. Client connects and sends its name as the first line\n2. Server calls ChatRoom.Join → \"*** Geir joined ***\" to all\n3. Client sends a line → server calls ChatRoom.SendMessage\n4. ChatRoom creates a ChatMessage and broadcasts it\n5. Each TcpClientConnection writes it to its client\n6. /quit or disconnect → ChatRoom.Leave → \"*** left ***\"",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "flow",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
